data:
Customer: FFS Renationalise the railways!!!
@GWRHelp @542104 
@120244 
@568273
GWRHelp: @286113 @542104 @120244 @568273 Hello Wyn. I am sorry for the delay this evening, the service has developed a fault which staff are investigating. - Jordan

Customer: Evening guys, do you know when advance tickets will be available for Saturday 6th Jan Paddington to Cardiff? Thanks.
@GWRHelp
GWRHelp: @349259 Hi Adam. We've only currently released them for weekends up to the end of the year. I can't say when but once more dates are released, this page will be updated: https://t.co/4BYUNd7mJY. Lewis

Customer: https://t.co/s9qb5ICBKE
@gwrhelp I assume this is your inspiration - looks a lot like the 16.30 Lon-Bath
GWRHelp: @137819 Hi Jo. Apologies for the busy conditions on board. The 1615 was cancelled which has meant more customers are travelling on your service - Josh

Customer: @GWRHelp so the boa 0709 cancelled, 0721 disappeared, 0729 only 2 coaches. Genius. &lt;Slow clap&gt;
GWRHelp: @613464 Hi Phil. Sorry for the disruption. This is due to more trains than normal being in maintenance for repairs. The 0721 is a @SW_Help service.
GWRHelp: nan

Customer: @GWRHelp Ref: GWRR170706BWBJ any idea when I will be getting my comp? put in the claim back in June!! &gt;&lt;
GWRHelp: @361124 Good morning. Thank you for your enquiry. One of the team will respond to you first thing in the morning. AndyD
GWRHelp: @361124 Sorry for the delay in this Alex. Please could you DM your full postal address? Phil. https://t.co/Fg4VGS9qNo

Customer: Pleased to be avoiding @232537 this evening.
@GWRHelp Service running on time, and I have a seat.
GWRHelp: @680260 @232537 Hi. Glad you're running to time. Enjoy your journey. Lewis

Customer: What a liberty, over and hour delay
@GWRHelp https://t.co/4UDnt5Yf0K
GWRHelp: @263382 Hello Daniel. Sorry for the delay. You can claim compensation here: https://t.co/kZncda4vMX - Jordan

Customer: OMG!!!
@GWRHelp IS ATTACHING AN EXTRA CARRIAGE TO GO TO WALES!!!
THANK YOU!!! 
@139601 @139602 
@127296 https://t.co/CnYhjw9z20
Customer: @139600 @GWRHelp @139601 @139602 Wow. @GWRHelp is this a permanent addition???
GWRHelp: @127296 @139600 @139601 @139602 Hi there. Extra carriages will be added when available. This can vary day by day - Josh
Customer: @GWRHelp @127296 @139600 @139601 @139602 These are not “extra” carriages they are the ones you SHOULD be providing!
GWRHelp: nan
